Description: Provides methods for win ratio and win odds analyses of
    hierarchical composite endpoints. The package supports two- and
    three-endpoint analyses, endpoint ordering, endpoint weighting,
    threshold-based comparisons, permutation inference, recurrent-event
    outcomes with pairwise common follow-up, real-data analysis, and
    simulation studies.
